sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Make as Make Target
    participant API as Spring Boot API
    participant Importer as Word Import Service
    participant Model as Embedding Model
    participant Redis as Redis Vector Store

    rect rgb(240, 247, 255)
        Note over User,Redis: Catalog import
        User->>Make: make import
        Make->>API: GET /actuator/health
        API-->>Make: Application and Redis are UP
        Make->>Make: Build a distributed deterministic dictionary sample
        Make->>API: POST /api/words/import?reset=true (text/plain)
        API->>Importer: Normalize, filter, and deduplicate terms
        Importer->>Model: Generate term embeddings in batches
        Model-->>Importer: Term vectors
        Importer->>Redis: Create index and store terms, metadata, and vectors
        Redis-->>Importer: Import acknowledged
        Importer-->>API: Import summary
        API-->>Make: Imported, skipped, and total counts
        Make-->>User: Import completed
    end

    rect rgb(245, 255, 245)
        Note over User,Redis: Semantic search
        User->>API: GET /api/words/semantic?q=...&limit=5
        API->>Model: Generate query embedding
        Model-->>API: Query vector
        API->>Redis: Find nearest term vectors
        Redis-->>API: Terms and similarity scores
        API->>API: Apply score threshold and rank results
        API-->>User: Top semantic matches
    end
